# Hades Helm Chart

Deploy the **Hades** build system (API, Scheduler, Operator, and NATS broker) into any Kubernetes cluster using Helm.

> This file is generated from `Readme.md.gotmpl`; the Values Reference table is produced by [helm-docs](https://github.com/norwoodj/helm-docs) from the comments in `values.yaml`. Run `make docs-helm` from the repository root to regenerate it. Edit the `.gotmpl` (not `Readme.md`) for prose changes.

